# Only what the Dockerfile copies is sent to the build at all: clark's own files, as in the download. No .git, tests, tools or data.
*
!clark
!src/clark
!vendor/README.md
!vendor/manifest.json
!vendor/et_xmlfile
!vendor/fonts
!vendor/licenses
!vendor/openpyxl
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.db
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
